harbor-page-welcome-title = Welcome to { -brand-short-name }
harbor-page-welcome-heading = You are all set
harbor-page-welcome-subheading = { -brand-short-name } is ready. Here is what makes it different from the browser you used before.
harbor-page-welcome-open-guide = Read the guide
harbor-page-welcome-open-mods = Browse mods
harbor-page-welcome-open-settings = Open settings
harbor-page-welcome-footer = You can come back to this page any time from the guide.
harbor-page-back-to-welcome = Back to the welcome page

harbor-page-guide-title = { -brand-short-name } Guide
harbor-page-guide-heading = { -brand-short-name } Guide
harbor-page-guide-subheading = A short tour of the features that are specific to { -brand-short-name }.

harbor-page-feature-spaces = Spaces
harbor-page-feature-spaces-short = Keep work, study and personal tabs apart.
harbor-page-feature-spaces-long = A space is its own set of tabs with its own name, icon and colors. Switch between spaces from the bottom of the sidebar. Tabs in one space stay out of the way while you are in another.
harbor-page-feature-essentials = Essentials
harbor-page-feature-essentials-short = The sites you open every day, one click away.
harbor-page-feature-essentials-long = Essentials are pinned at the top of the sidebar as icons and stay there in every space. Drag a tab to the top of the sidebar to add it.
harbor-page-feature-split-view = Split View
harbor-page-feature-split-view-short = Put up to four tabs side by side.
harbor-page-feature-split-view-long = Select several tabs and choose Split from the tab context menu, or drag a tab onto the page. A split group can hold up to four tabs, and you can resize and rearrange them.
harbor-page-feature-glance = Glance
harbor-page-feature-glance-short = Peek at a link without leaving the page.
harbor-page-feature-glance-long = Glance opens a link in a floating preview over the current page. Close it to go back, or expand it into a tab of its own. The way Glance is triggered is set in the settings.
harbor-page-feature-compact-mode = Compact Mode
harbor-page-feature-compact-mode-short = Hide the sidebar and toolbar until you need them.
harbor-page-feature-compact-mode-long = Compact Mode hides the sidebar, the toolbar, or both, and shows them again when the pointer reaches the edge of the window. Turn it on from the sidebar context menu.
harbor-page-feature-window-sync = Window Sync
harbor-page-feature-window-sync-long = Windows on the same device stay in sync, so changes made in one window show up in the others right away. Use an unsynced window when you want a window with tabs of its own.
harbor-page-feature-mods = Mods
harbor-page-feature-mods-long = Mods are small style changes for the browser window. Install them from the mod store, and turn them on and off or remove them in the settings.
harbor-page-feature-share = Sharing
harbor-page-feature-share-long = Share a space, a folder or a split view as a link. Whoever opens the link in { -brand-short-name } gets a preview and can import it. Sharing is available once a share server is set up for this build.
harbor-page-feature-direct = Direct Russian sites
harbor-page-feature-direct-short = Russian sites keep working while a VPN is on.
harbor-page-feature-direct-long = When a local proxy or a VPN client is running, sites in the .ru, .su and .рф zones, VK and Yandex are opened directly instead of through the tunnel. The harbor.proxy.ru-direct.enabled preference in about:config turns this off.

harbor-page-mods-title = { -brand-short-name } Mods
harbor-page-mods-heading = Mod store
harbor-page-mods-subheading = Small style changes for the browser window. Installed mods apply right away.
harbor-page-mods-manage = Manage installed mods
harbor-page-mods-loading = Loading the store…
harbor-page-mods-empty = There are no mods in the store yet.
harbor-page-mods-load-error = The mod store could not be loaded.
harbor-page-mods-action-error = That did not work. Try again.
harbor-page-mods-install = Install
harbor-page-mods-remove = Remove
